  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Distributed Power Generation/Fresh Water Production for Coastal Fishing Villages, through Government of Morocco</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The technical assistance (TA) with the Office National des Peches (ONP) [National Office of Fish] and Nexant provided a master plan for implementing renewable energy resources in remote fishing villages. The TA included an analysis of solar photovoltaic (PV) and small scale wind applications in six pilot fishing villages, resulting in a model for the application of sustainable sources of energy for electricity generation and clean water filtration in up to 60 fishing villages.</narrative>
  </description>
